hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1061","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Sa'd bin Ubada (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se fatwa manga. Phir unhon ne arz kiya: Beshak meri walida faut ho gayi hain jabke un par nazr hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use un ki taraf se poora karo."
"1062","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne nazr se mana farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo koi cheez nahi lautati. Wo to kanjoos se nikalwayi jati hai."
"1063","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ko nazr koi cheez nahi deti jo us ke liye muqaddar nahi hui. Lekin nazr use muqaddar ki taraf dalti hai jo us ke liye muqaddar hui. Phir Allah us se kanjoos se nikalta hai. Phir Wo us par deta hai jo wo us par pehle nahi deta tha."
"1064","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek budhe ko dekha jo apne dono beton ke darmiyan sahara diye hue tha. Aap ne farmaya: Is ka kya haal hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Us ne paidal chalne ki nazr mani hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah is ke apne aap ko azab dene se be-niyaz hai. Aur Aap ne use sawar hone ka hukm diya."
"1065","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri behan ne Baitullah ki taraf paidal chalne ki nazr mani. Aur us ne mujhe hukm diya ke main us ke liye Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se fatwa mangun. Phir main ne Aap se fatwa manga. To Aap (alaihissalam) ne farmaya: Wo paidal chale aur sawari par sawar ho."
